\pard\b\fs20 Grand Depths Melee\b0\par
\fs16\par
It is a world of wipfs, oil and lava: deep under the ground, the clonks fight a war far from any sunlight.\par
The main part of the game is to find and destroy the enemy while keeping your own settlement hidden from your foes.\par
You can light the dark tunnels with torches and expand your territory.\par
The players should be good at cave climbing.\par
It is played almost exclusively with classic clonks and fundamental settlement objects.\par
